## ENTRANCE ANIMATION

Each content element fades in from below with staggered delays:
```css
.anim-item {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(22px);
    animation: enterUp 0.75s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) forwards;
    animation-delay: calc(0.25s + var(--i, 0) * 0.12s);
}
```
Use CSS custom property `--i` on each element to control stagger order (0, 1, 2, 3, 4).

